I have enclosed my source code to this program so that if anyone wants to
make any changes, they are able to with a minimum of hassle.  I would only
ask that if you do make some changes, that you please forward me a copy.


All of my code is written in MC68000 assembler using Devpac 3.02 from HiSoft,
with a TAB size of 16.  All of the programs are designed to be assembled
directly to disk via the Editor of Devpac 3, and thus do not require linking
etc...


I make use of a pre-assembled include file called 'mysystem.gs'.  This is a
modification of the system.gs file that comes with Devpac 3, and should be
compatible.  The main difference is that I have included more of the Include
files, and in some places use later releases of the include files.

